230-15H.YAG, 2-ele. 15' boom, heavy-duty elements
10.100 10.125 10.150 MHz
2 elements, inches
           4.684    2.250    2.000    1.000    0.875 
  0.000   12.000  108.000  120.000   15.000   50.250 
174.000   12.000  108.000  120.000   15.000   14.875 

The mounting bracket is a 6" x 24" x 0.5" plate,
represented by the 4.684" equivalent OD pipe, 12"
on each side of boom. These elements are designed
for 107 mph winds without ice; 93 mpw with 1/4-inch
ice.

Front-to-rear ratio is better than 10 dB across band,
and SWR is less than 1.1:1 across band, with a mid-
band free-space gain of 6.4 dBi.
